{"id":"sh/1076lobm","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 7","position":{"left":89.28,"top":358.08,"width":512.64,"height":166.08},"text":"小型化するとアンテナと電池が制約。\n建物・姿勢で測位が不安定になる。\n\n引っ掛かり、脱落、充電切れへの対応と、\n無線の適合・位置履歴の保護も必要。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/hcfy9k3u","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 8","position":{"left":643.2,"top":312,"width":563.52,"height":225.6},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/gb6x0zm9","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 9","position":{"left":660.48,"top":323.52,"width":309.94,"height":26.88},"text":"どうすれば解決できそうか","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/vaxg7ulo","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 10","position":{"left":660.48,"top":358.08,"width":528.96,"height":166.08},"text":"在宅時は省電力、捜索時は更新を増やす。\n安全バックルと脱落時の表示を検討。\n\n誤差・取得時刻・圏外を表示し、\n位置の共有権限と履歴削除を設ける。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
